"""Render dated result; candidates stay offline regardless of scores."""
from common import *
import html
labels=json.loads((OUT/'labels.json').read_text());selected=json.loads((OUT/'selected.json').read_text());mac=json.loads((OUT/'mac-rf.json').read_text());pi=json.loads((OUT/'pi-rf.json').read_text());training={k:json.loads((OUT/k/'training.json').read_text()) for k in ['raw','dsp']};controls=json.loads((OUT/'controls.json').read_text());health=json.loads((OUT/'pi-health.json').read_text());assert health['live_unchanged']
summary=dict(decision='Keep both companions offline; no unique additions beyond the full current pipeline on the chronological RF holdout. No live changes.',selected=selected['variant'],qualified_recent_windows=labels['counts']['qualified_stock_nofix'],new_split_windows={k:v['new'] for k,v in labels['splits'].items()},new_qualified_far180={k:v['new_far180'] for k,v in labels['splits'].items()},quarantined_crc_windows=labels['crc_audit']['quarantined'],selected_window_metrics=training[selected['variant']]['metrics'],rf_seconds=pi['rf_seconds'],baseline_guarded_extras=pi['baseline_guarded_extras'],unique_additions=pi['unique_additions_beyond_complete_pipeline'],beyond180_additions=sum(v.get('candidate_additions',0) for k,v in pi['distance_bins'].items() if k in ['180-200','200-250','250+']),losses=pi['raw_extension_losses'],pi_baseline_cpu_s_per_rf_s=pi['baseline_cpu_seconds_per_rf_second'],pi_extra_inference_cpu_s_per_rf_s=pi['incremental_inference_cpu_seconds_per_rf_second'],pi_extra_inference_percent=pi['incremental_inference_percent_of_baseline'],mac_extra_inference_percent=mac['incremental_inference_percent_of_baseline'],controls=controls,limitations=['Only eight new qualifying >=180nm train windows, one validation window, zero new test windows; no far-range generalization claim. Historical far-range labels were not used for new far weighting.','Field RF was reserved before fitting but recorded before checkpoint freeze; not post-freeze prospective data. Field RF is chronological, not ICAO-disjoint; 23 stock packets repeat a training payload. Window splits are ICAO/payload/IQ-disjoint.','Stock-assisted CRC-valid labels are not independent physical ground truth. All CRC research candidates remain quarantined; none had same-transmission stock confirmation.','Some archives contain open/unclosed packet journals; only individually closed, stream-complete continuous RF bursts enter this experiment.','Baseline is full enabled serial replay plus actual stock/unified masks, not a claim that historical archive routing matched current routing. Replay includes all three old neural models, coherent pair retries and Stream1090.','Serial algorithm CPU includes duplicate frontend work across replay branches and Stream1090 children; excludes live transport/network overhead and is not whole-device electrical power.','No hyperparameter or model tuning followed the chronological RF replay. Additional controls only audited the already frozen candidates.'],live_changed=False)
write(OUT/'summary.json',summary)
rows=''.join(f'<tr><td>{k}</td><td>{r["metrics"]["validation"]["additions"]}</td><td>{r["metrics"]["test"]["additions"]}</td><td>{r["noise"]["valid"]}/20,000</td><td>{r["export"]["bit_differences"]}</td></tr>' for k,r in training.items())
splits=''.join(f'<tr><td>{k}</td><td>{v["windows"]}</td><td>{v["new"]}</td><td>{v["new_far180"]}</td></tr>' for k,v in labels['splits'].items())
bins=''.join(f'<tr><td>{k}</td><td>{v.get("current_guarded_dsp_extras",0)}</td><td>{v.get("candidate_additions",0)}</td></tr>' for k,v in pi['distance_bins'].items())
limitations=''.join('<li>'+html.escape(x)+'</li>' for x in summary['limitations'])
page=f'''<!doctype html><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Recent-data neural companion — 29 October 2026</title><style>body{{font:17px system-ui;line-height:1.55;max-width:1100px;margin:35px auto;padding:20px;background:#101c29;color:#e8eff8}}td,th{{padding:11px;border-bottom:1px solid #46566a;text-align:left}}a{{color:#9bd6ff}}.box{{background:#203449;padding:20px;border-radius:12px}}table{{border-collapse:collapse}}</style><h1>Recent-data neural companion</h1><p>29 October 2026 · offline experiment · actual target Raspberry Pi 5</p><div class="box"><b>Result: keep the working models.</b> The frozen companion added <b>0 unique packets</b> beyond the complete current pipeline, including <b>0 beyond 180 nm</b>, over {pi['rf_seconds']:.2f} RF seconds. No baseline packets were lost. Models, gain, routing, feeders and collection were unchanged.</div><h2>Labels and split protection</h2><p>All 17 downloaded saved archives passed SHA-256 transfer checks. Independent uncorrected readsb replay and same-transmission live stock agreement qualified {labels['counts']['qualified_stock_nofix']:,} candidate windows. RF reservations, duplicate payload/IQ and cross-split RF checks reduced these to 3,355 new prepared windows. All 16,509 CRC research windows stay quarantined: later repetitions/same ICAO were never promoted into training truth.</p><table><tr><th>Split</th><th>Total windows</th><th>New windows</th><th>New qualifying ≥180 nm</th></tr>{splits}</table><p>Recent ranges require a causal stock position, NIC/NACp≥5, no MLAT coordinates and age≤15 seconds. Only newly qualified distant examples receive additional distance weight. The original fixed window holdouts remain present; added windows follow compatible aircraft groups and disjoint RF intervals.</p><h2>Training and controls</h2><p>Two fixed-seed, 1,000-step runs retain the production input shape. Both mix historical RF, qualified recent RF, AWGN/timing degradation, synthetic replay and preservation distillation. The DSP run adds fractional-timing and preamble-derived matched-I/Q views. Checkpoints and the single companion were selected using validation only; test/RF scores did not influence selection. Selected: <b>{selected['variant']}</b>, step {training[selected['variant']]['selected_step']}.</p><table><tr><th>Candidate</th><th>Validation gains over old neural cascade</th><th>Test gains over old neural cascade</th><th>Noise valid</th><th>Export bit differences</th></tr>{rows}</table><p>These gains use supplied packet windows and are <b>not</b> extra field detections. A synthetic overlap control produced one non-target CRC-valid output per candidate; the secondary-source audit is in controls.json. Such outputs do not become training labels.</p><h2>Full current pipeline replay</h2><p>Enabled baseline: stock + energy + restricted CRC processing + timing + soft + matched + Rust coherent/pair retry + original-first three-model neural cascade + Stream1090. Quarantined Broad CRC packets are excluded from production recovery counts, while their computation is included. All recorded stock/unified packets also mask candidate additions. Sequence, acquisition, pulse, header and SIC remain off.</p><p>Mac and Pi accepted packet/timestamp signatures and distance bins match exactly. Baseline guarded DSP extras: <b>{pi['baseline_guarded_extras']}</b>; new unique extras: <b>0</b>; raw extension losses: <b>0</b>. Original outputs are kept first.</p><table><tr><th>Range nm</th><th>Current guarded extras beyond stock</th><th>New companion additions</th></tr>{bins}</table><h2>CPU</h2><p>Pi baseline serial algorithm CPU: {pi['baseline_cpu_seconds_per_rf_second']:.4f} CPU seconds per RF second. Additional companion inference: {pi['incremental_inference_cpu_seconds_per_rf_second']:.4f} CPU seconds/RF second, or <b>{pi['incremental_inference_percent_of_baseline']:.2f}%</b> of baseline algorithm CPU. Mac additional inference: {mac['incremental_inference_percent_of_baseline']:.2f}%. This is a single frozen RF run, not an electrical-power estimate. Target replay used nice 19/core 3/35% quota/1 GiB RAM/900-second maximum and never opened the SDR or forwarded candidates. Protected service PIDs, configurations, loss counters and feed health passed.</p><h2>Interpretation and next data needed</h2><p>The candidate improves a few isolated packet reconstructions, but the enabled DSP/Stream1090 union already covers them on this RF. The far-range training and validation sample is too small. Prefer stock-supported difficult distant windows, independent waveform/timestamp checks, and time-spread RF with complete stock/accepted-output journals. Keep all uncertain weak/overlap cases quarantined. No collection change was made here.</p><ul>{limitations}</ul><p><a href="summary.json">Summary</a> · <a href="labels.json">Label audit</a> · <a href="dataset-audit.json">Split audit</a> · <a href="controls.json">Controls</a> · <a href="mac-rf.json">Mac RF benchmark</a> · <a href="pi-rf.json">Pi RF benchmark</a> · <a href="parity.json">Parity</a> · <a href="pi-health.json">Protected health</a></p>'''
(OUT/'report.html').write_text(page)
